# Riichi discard ronned: riichi is NOT accepted, no reach_accepted event is emitted,
# and the 1,000-point stick is NOT paid (engine.md §4.1 row 1, §4.2).
# Scoring for Seat 1 (non-dealer, South):
#   Hand: 234m 678m 234p 56s 88p + ron 7s
#   Yaku: pinfu (1) + tanyao (1) = 2 han. Dora indicator 1z -> dora 2z (0 dora).
#   Fu: 20 base + 10 menzen ron = 30 fu.
#   Non-dealer ron 2 han 30 fu = 2000 from Seat 0.
#   Seat 0 keeps its 1,000 riichi stick (deltas: -2000 +2000 0 0, sticks: 0).

[meta]
name: riichi_discard_ronned
title: Ron on a riichi declaration discard cancels reach_accepted and pays no stick
